- Error handling for invalid arguments
- Traversal strategies that avoid unnecessary queries and minimize the impact of dynamic content updates
- Support for modern JavaScript features (Map, Set, Promises)
- Safety measures against infinite recursion or memory leaks in malformed HTML structures

The module provides a flexible API to traverse and process large-scale web page DOM structures dynamically, considering real-world constraints such as varying network conditions and user interactions."]

