- is_range_overlapping(): Checks if two IP ranges overlap.
- assign_config(): Assigns a new configuration to an available slot within the array, considering potential conflicts and resolving them.
- resize_network_configs(): Resizes the network configurations array dynamically to support variable network sizes and configurations without significant performance degradation.']

